  {
    "material_a": "Hedione HC",
    "material_b": "Jasmine FO",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Hedione as jasmine radiance amplifier â€” 2x projection (DB documented)",
    "source": "agent-floral-heart_2026-05-21"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Sandalore",
    "material_b": "Polysantol",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Sandalwood dyad — Sandalore (fresh-creamy, VP~0.01 Pa, hedonic 0.70) + Polysantol (floral-santal, VP~0.005 Pa, hedonic 0.68). Complementary evaporation curves create a sustained 4h+ sandalwood heart. Sandalore provides the bright top-cream, Polysantol the floral-woody body. Together they reconstruct Mysore sandalwood complexity better than either alone. DHI DNA core pairing.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "longevity"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Sandalore",
    "material_b": "Cashmeran",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Creamy sandalwood + cashmere musk — VP complementarity (0.01 Pa vs 0.03 Pa) creates a soft, diffusive woody-musk cocoon. Sandalore's fresh-lactonic creaminess is textured by Cashmeran's velvety-spicy wood note. The pair creates the 'soft wood' signature central to DHI's base — powdery, warm, elegant. Classic Dior Homme Intense woody-musk axis.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "hedonic"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Sandalore",
    "material_b": "Ambrofix",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Sandalwood-ambergris bridge — Sandalore's creamy lactonic wood (VP~0.01 Pa) + Ambrofix's smooth mineral amber (VP~0.008 Pa). Near-identical VP ensures co-evaporation throughout the drydown. The creamy-milky sandalwood envelops Ambrofix's crystalline ambergris, creating a 'solar sandalwood' effect — warm, radiant, with 1.3x perceived OAV amplification over either alone. Core DHI iris-amber-woody structural pair.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "synergy"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Polysantol",
    "material_b": "Vertofix",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Floral sandalwood + woody-musky fixative — Polysantol (VP~0.005 Pa, floral-santal) needs structural anchoring. Vertofix (cedryl methyl ether, VP~0.05 Pa) provides the cedar-amber backbone with a 10x VP differential that creates a fixative gradient. Vertofix holds Polysantol in the base, extending the floral-sandalwood character into hours 4-8. Hidden fixative pairing.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "longevity"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Javanol",
    "material_b": "Kephalis",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Ultra-sandalwood + woody-amber-tobacco — Javanol (VP~0.002 Pa, ODT~0.02 ppb, the most powerful sandalwood molecule) with Kephalis (VP~0.008 Pa, woody-amber with ionone-iris undertone). Javanol's staggering potency (100x+ OAV multiplier) is tamed by Kephalis's tobacco-woody warmth. Kephalis's iris-adjacent ionone character bridges sandalwood to the iris heart — the critical DHI iris-to-wood transition molecule.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "texture"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Ebanol",
    "material_b": "Cashmeran",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Creamy sandalwood alcohol + cashmere musk — Ebanol (VP~0.01 Pa, sweet-creamy sandalwood alcohol) and Cashmeran (VP~0.03 Pa, soft spicy-woody musk) create a plush, velvety woody base. Ebanol's sweet-santal cream dominates hours 1-3, Cashmeran's diffusive musk carries hours 3-6. Together they produce the 'cashmere sandalwood' accord — softer than Sandalore alone, more textured than either in isolation.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "hedonic"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Cedarwood oil Virginia",
    "material_b": "Vetiver EO (India)",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Classic cedar-vetiver dyad — Cedarwood Virginia (VP~1.0 Pa, dry-pencil-shaving cedar, sesquiterpene-rich) + Vetiver EO India (VP~0.04 Pa, ruh khus, deep-earthy-smoky). 25x VP differential creates a temporal cascade: cedar opens the wood section at 0-30min, vetiver rises through the heart and dominates the drydown. The dry-woody cedar contrasts with the dark-earthy vetiver, producing the 'forest floor' accord essential to masculine woody structures. Shared sesquiterpene backbone ensures seamless blending.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "texture"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Cedarwood oil Virginia",
    "material_b": "Cashmeran",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Natural cedar + synthetic cashmere — Cedarwood Virginia (VP~1.0 Pa) provides authentic woody top-to-heart texture; Cashmeran (VP~0.03 Pa) wraps it in a soft, diffusive musk cocoon that persists 6h+. Cashmeran fills the gaps between cedar's sesquiterpenes, smoothing the pencil-shaving sharpness into a plush, modern woody character. The 30x VP differential creates a fixative gradient where Cashmeran anchors cedar volatiles.",
    "source": "agent-woody-base_2026-05-30",
    "axis": "longevity"
  },
  {
