    "effect": "Hexyl Salicylate's herbaceous-green, slightly sweet salicylate character pairs beautifully with Galaxolide's clean volume. The salicylate provides a green-herbal undertone that prevents the musk from becoming overly laundry-sweet. The musk in turn diffuses the salicylate, which has moderate volatility.",
    "source": "agent-musk-fixative_2026-05-21",
    "axis": "depth"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Benzyl Benzoate",
    "material_b": "Ethylene Brassylate",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Benzyl Benzoate (nearly odorless, VP~0.01 Pa) serves as a solvent/fixative for Ethylene Brassylate, which is a solid crystalline material at room temperature. Benzyl Benzoate dissolves EB effectively and smooths its deposition on skin. The fixative-in-fixative pairing optimizes physical handling and evaporation profile.",
    "source": "agent-musk-fixative_2026-05-21",
    "axis": "depth"
