    "effect": "Dual salicylate fixative chord. Benzyl Salicylate (faint floral-balsamic, VP~0.005 Pa) provides a warm floral-fixative character. Hexyl Salicylate (herbaceous-green, VP slightly higher) provides a greener, fresher fixative effect. Together they create a complete fixative base covering floral-warm and green-fresh salicylate characters.",
