    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Classic fixative duo. Benzyl Benzoate is nearly odorless but slows evaporation of all materials. Benzyl Salicylate adds a faint floral-balsamic signature to the fixative base. Used together they provide both structural fixative function and subliminal character. Foundational in virtually all commercial fragrance concentrates at 5–15% combined.",
