  {
    "material_a": "Labdanum Resinoid",
    "material_b": "Isobutyl Quinoline",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Labdanum (leathery-amber resinoid) + Isobutyl Quinoline (IBQ, dirty green quinoline leather) = amplified leather accord — the classic Russian Leather (Cuir de Russie) backbone. Labdanum provides the warm, slightly animalic amber-leather body; IBQ provides the harsh, green, dirty leather edge. Together they create a complete leather profile: IBQ supplies the leather 'attack' while labdanum supplies the warm leather 'body' that lingers for hours. The combination achieves leather character exceeding either at 2x dose.",
    "source": "agent-musk-fixative_2026-05-21",
    "axis": "stacking_depth"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Evernyl",
    "material_b": "Isobutyl Quinoline",
    "type": "synergy",
    "effect": "Evernyl (methyl orsellinate, mossy-phenolic, the core odorant of oakmoss) + Isobutyl Quinoline (dirty green leather) = moss-leather chypre accord. Evernyl's phenolic-mossy earthiness and IBQ's green-leather aggression create the dark, mossy-leather profile characteristic of classic leather-chypre hybrids. Evernyl's structure and tenacity (+ oakmoss character) ground IBQ's bite; IBQ adds the leather aggression that transforms moss from merely earthy to dangerously leathery. Essential for leather-chypre and DHP-style dark leather-iris compositions.",
    "source": "agent-musk-fixative_2026-05-21",
    "axis": "stacking_depth"
  },
  {
    "material_a": "Suederal",
    "material_b": "Vanillin",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Suederal (soft, powdery, suede-leather, cLogP 3.0) + Vanillin (creamy vanilla) = soft suede-vanilla accord. The powdery suede character of Suederal integrates seamlessly with vanillin's creamy sweetness to create a warm, velvety leather-gourmand base. Suederal's inherent softness prevents the vanilla from becoming foody; vanilla's sweetness softens suederal's leather further. Ideal for the DHI drydown where soft suede meets sweet vanilla-warmth — modern, luxurious, skin-friendly.",
    "source": "agent-musk-fixative_2026-05-21",
    "axis": "texture"
