    "effect": "Siam Benzoin (vanilla-almond balsamic warmth) + Isobutyl Quinoline (dirty green leather) = balsamic-leather accord. Benzoin's sweet-vanilla body wraps around IBQ's harsh leather bite, softening and tempering it. The balsamic sweetness of benzoin provides a smooth canvas on which IBQ's leather character can express itself without becoming aggressive. This pairing is the gentlest leather entry point — benzoin-forward, leather-supported — suitable for iris-leather compositions where the leather must whisper, not shout.",
