    "effect": "Siam Benzoin (vanilla-balsamic warmth) + Suederal (soft suede-powder leather) = warm balsamic-suede accord. Benzoin's sweet vanilla-almond body and Suederal's powdery suede character merge into a unified balsamic-leather profile that reads as luxurious and skin-friendly. The benzoin provides the warm amber-resin structure; the suede provides the subtle leather identity. Together they create a suede that feels sweet, soft, and enveloping — perfect for the benzoin-suede base of DHI-style compositions.",
