    "material_b": "Suederal",
    "type": "pairing",
    "effect": "Labdanum (leathery-amber resinoid) + Suederal (soft suede leather) = layered amber-suede accord spanning harsh to soft leather textures. Labdanum provides the deep, slightly rough animalic-amber leather body; Suederal provides the polished suede surface. The contrast between labdanum's warm roughness and Suederal's powdery softness creates a two-texture leather — worn-in rawhide beneath with suede finish above. This pairing is the structural leather base for DHP-style compositions with labdanum's amber endurance and suede's modern elegance.",
